==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{m|ine-pro|*atro-ek}}, from {{m|ine-pro||*h₂eh₁tro-h₃kʷs|having the appearance of fire}}, from {{m|ine-pro||*h₂eh₁tro-}} (suffixed, metathesized form of {{m|ine-pro|*h₂eh₁ter-||fire}}) + {{m|ine-pro|*h₃ekʷ-||eye; to see}}. The first root also gives the cognates of {{etyl|ae|-}} {{m|ae|𐬁𐬙𐬀𐬭𐬱||fire}}, {{etyl|xum|-}} {{m|xum||tr=atru|sc=Ital}}, {{etyl|osc|-}} {{m|osc||tr=Aadíriis|sc=Ital}}, {{etyl|ga|-}} {{m|ga|áith||kiln}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/ˈa.troːks/|lang=la}}

